---
layout: article
title: MCP server for Appwrite docs
description: Appwrite documentation access is now part of the Appwrite MCP server
---

The standalone MCP server for Appwrite documentation has been consolidated into the [Appwrite MCP server](/docs/tooling/ai/mcp-servers/api). The unified server exposes the `appwrite_search_docs` tool alongside the Appwrite API tools, so your AI assistant can semantically search the Appwrite documentation and operate on your Appwrite project through a single connection:

```
https://mcp.appwrite.io/
```

Once connected, you can ask documentation questions like:

- `Show me how to set up real-time subscriptions that trigger on creation of a user`
- `What are some of the best security practices for Appwrite Auth in a web app with SSR?`
- `I want an example of how I can list all users in a Python app`

